---
import { Instagram, Linkedin, Twitter, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
---

<footer class="bg-charcoal text-surface pt-20 pb-10 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-20">
    <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-1">
      <a 
        href="/"
        class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold tracking-tight text-white flex flex-col leading-none mb-6 text-left"
      >
        <span>ESTRANOVA</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] font-sans font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary mt-1">THE CLINICAL CURATOR</span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-surface/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Kadın sağlığında bilimsel temelli, klinik hassasiyetle küratörlüğü yapılmış rehberlik ve destek platformu.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-surface/10 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-surface hover:text-charcoal transition-all">
          <Instagram size={18} />
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-surface/10 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-surface hover:text-charcoal transition-all">
          <Linkedin size={18} />
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-surface/10 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-surface hover:text-charcoal transition-all">
          <Twitter size={18} />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="font-serif text-lg mb-6 text-white">Kütüphane</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-surface/60">
        <li><a href="/library" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Perimenopoz Rehberi</a></li>
        <li><a href="/library" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Hormon Replasman Tedavisi</a></li>
        <li><a href="/library" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Bilişsel Sağlık</a></li>
        <li><a href="/library" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Kemik Yoğunluğu</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="font-serif text-lg mb-6 text-white">Kurumsal</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-surface/60">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Hakkımızda</a></li>
        <li><a href="/methodology" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Metodoloji</a></li>
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Uzman Kurulumuz</a></li>
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors">İletişim</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="font-serif text-lg mb-6 text-white">Bülten</h4>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface/60 mb-4">Klinik güncellemeler ve yeni araştırmalardan haberdar olun.</p>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <input 
          type="email" 
          placeholder="E-posta adresiniz" 
          class="bg-surface/5 border border-surface/10 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm flex-1 focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary"
        />
        <button class="bg-secondary text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-secondary/80 transition-colors">
          <ArrowRight size={18} />
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-10 border-t border-surface/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest text-surface/40 uppercase">
    <p>© 2024 ESTRANOVA. TÜM HAKLARI SAKLIDIR.</p>
    <div class="flex gap-8">
      <button class="hover:text-white transition-colors">GİZLİLİK POLİTİKASI</button>
      <button class="hover:text-white transition-colors">KULLANIM ŞARTLARI</button>
      <button class="hover:text-white transition-colors">ÇEREZ AYARLARI</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
